{"ID":"20240205153758-tynlpdj","Spec":"1","Type":"NodeDocument","Properties":{"id":"20240205153758-tynlpdj","scroll":"\u0026#123;\u0026quot;rootId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240205153758-tynlpdj\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;startId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206095412-culq6r4\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;endId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240206094501-1kx4ajg\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;scrollTop\u0026quot;:200,\u0026quot;focusId\u0026quot;:\u0026quot;20240619182630-tu6vzr3\u0026quot;,\u0026quot;focusStart\u0026quot;:3,\u0026quot;focusEnd\u0026quot;:3\u0026#125;","title":"豆蔻（草豆蔻、白豆蔻、红豆蔻、肉豆蔻）","type":"doc","updated":"20240902174950"},"Children":[{"ID":"20240206095412-culq6r4","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095412-culq6r4","updated":"20240726165654"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"豆蔻"}]},{"ID":"20240206095423-wrqrokh","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095423-wrqrokh","updated":"20240206095430"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产泰国、柬埔寨、缅甸等国。\n【性状】\t种子类球形或椭圆形，具较明显的3钝棱及3浅沟，长1.53cm，直径1.53cm；表面灰棕色或黄棕色；中间有黄白色或淡棕色隔膜分成3室，每室有种子2290 (110) 颗，不易散开。种子叶卵圆状多面体，长35mm，直径2.53mm，背面稍隆起，较厚一端有圆窝状种脐，合点位于较扁端的中央微凹处，腹面有一纵沟，淡褐色种脊沿着纵沟自种脐直达合点，沿合点再向背面也有一纵沟，沟的末端不达种脐。质硬，断面乳白色。气芳香，味辛、辣。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t化湿消痞，行气温中，开胃消食。用于湿浊中阻，不思饮食，湿温初起，胸闷不饥，寒湿呕逆，胸腹胀痛，食积不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240206095420-nyew87d","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206095420-nyew87d","updated":"20240206095420"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206095420-pr4fzo9.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727113601-zfdprgs","Type":"NodeThematicBreak","Properties":{"id":"20240727113601-zfdprgs"}},{"ID":"20240206094514-xhewc2n","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094514-xhewc2n","updated":"20240727113616"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeTextMark","TextMarkType":"strong","TextMarkTextContent":"草豆蔻（草寇）"}]},{"ID":"20240206094526-061loih","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094526-061loih","updated":"20240206094529"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"【产地】\t主产广东、广西、海南等地。\n【性状】\t该品为类球形的种子团，直径1.52.7cm。表面灰褐色，中间有黄白色的隔膜，将种子团分成3 瓣，每瓣有种子多数，粘连紧密，种子团略光滑。种子为卵圆状多面体，长35mm，直径约3mm，外被淡棕色膜质假种皮，种脊为一条纵沟，一端有种脐；质硬，将种子沿种脊纵剖两瓣，纵断面观呈斜心形，种皮沿种脊向内伸入部分约占整个表面积的1/2 ；胚乳灰白色。气香，味辛，微苦。\n【性味】\t辛，温。\n【功效】\t化湿消痞，行气温中，开胃消食。用于湿浊中阻，不思饮食，湿温初起胸闷不饥，寒湿呕逆，胸腹胀痛，食积不消。"}]},{"ID":"20240206094521-96bamfl","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240206094521-96bamfl","updated":"20240206094521"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"image"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/image-20240206094521-e2r67jf.png"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727110704-hkttawy","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727110704-hkttawy","updated":"20240727110704"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 649px;","style":"width: 639px;"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeBang"},{"Type":"NodeOpenBracket"},{"Type":"NodeLinkText","Data":"草豆蔻"},{"Type":"NodeCloseBracket"},{"Type":"NodeOpenParen"},{"Type":"NodeLinkDest","Data":"assets/草豆蔻-20240727110704-kkyqben.jpg"},{"Type":"NodeCloseParen"}]},{"Type":"NodeKramdownSpanIAL","Data":"{: style=\"width: 639px;\" parent-style=\"width: 649px;\"}"},{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"}]},{"ID":"20240727124257-3yv0ol9","Type":"NodeParagraph","Properties":{"id":"20240727124257-3yv0ol9","updated":"20240727124257"},"Children":[{"Type":"NodeText","Data":"​"},{"Type":"NodeImage","Data":"span","Properties":{"parent-style":"width: 650px;","style":"width: 640px;"},"Childre